cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "eplmodel: leakage-safe English Premier League match-probability models"
abstract: >-
  Research code for estimating English Premier League match-outcome
  probabilities (Elo with multinomial logistic regression, static Poisson,
  staged Dixon-Coles) with chronological walk-forward evaluation, proper
  scoring rules, golden regression tests and a documented test-set access log.
  Not betting advice.
authors:
  - given-names: Dipin
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/dipinpandey2007-svg/epl-betting-model"
keywords:
  - football
  - Premier League
  - Elo
  - Poisson regression
  - Dixon-Coles
  - probabilistic forecasting
  - reproducible research
